*.csv

# Benchmark corpus and results
wx_corpus/
bench_*.json
truth.json

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
venv*/
.venv/

# --- secrets ---------------------------------------------------------------
# API keys live in loose files beside webui.py and are read at run time. None
# of them belong here, under any spelling.
*API_Key*.txt
*API_KEY*.txt
*api_key*.txt
*_KEY.txt
*.lic

# --- the live configuration ------------------------------------------------
# watchkeeper.toml carries the vessel name, the home position and the address
# of the boat's Signal K server. The tuning in it is worth publishing; those
# values are not. Commit watchkeeper.example.toml instead.
watchkeeper.toml

# --- recorded traffic and anything derived from it -------------------------
# The database holds every transcript. The briefs hold transcripts AND the
# position the vessel was at when each was written, which is a movement
# history: the most sensitive thing this system produces.
watchkeeper/
briefs/
audio/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.wav
*.kml

# --- survey and benchmark output -------------------------------------------
boat_scan.csv
bench_*/
*-venv/
venv_*/
wk-venv/
run.log

# --- patch backups and scratch ---------------------------------------------
*.pre-*
*.bak
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.xsession-errors*
